Revision history for Geo-Coder-DataScienceToolkit

0.03	Sat Oct 17 07:58:42 PM EDT 2026
	geocode(): croak when input is just a set of numbers
	Use JSON::MaybeXS instead of JSON
	Use gtar to create a distribution on Macs
	Use Test::Needs and Object::Configure
	Use Test::DescribeMe to simplify tests
	Handle broken smokers
	geocode(): refuse a reference; it used to be accepted because the string it
		turns into contains a non-digit
	Check a reference against Geo::Coder::Free::Validate's rule when that module
		is installed, so that the check cannot drift away from Geo::Coder::Free
	Added t/reference.t, the same test as the other Geo::Coder distributions

0.02	Sat Feb  2 08:02:49 EST 2019
	Documentation fixes

0.01	Fri Feb  1 14:59:14 EST 2019
        First version
